# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit .dev.vars.
# The Deploy to Cloudflare button also reads this file and asks for each value as a secret,
# so only secrets belong here. `npm run dev` sets ENVIRONMENT=dev by itself.
# A random string of at least 32 characters. Make one with: openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
# Only this email can claim a new install, at /setup. A code is sent to it.
OWNER_EMAIL=you@example.com
# Optional. The address emails come from until the owner picks one on the Email screen.
# Not needed for local development: emails are saved to /dev/outbox instead of being sent.
# EMAIL_FROM=hello@example.com
